#  SwiftCart – E-commerce Website

SwiftCart is a modern and responsive e-commerce website designed to provide a smooth online shopping experience. It features dynamic product browsing, shopping cart functionality, and a checkout flow.

##  Features

- Responsive and modern user interface
- Dynamic product browsing
- Shopping cart functionality
- Checkout flow
- Backend powered by Node.js and Express.js
- MySQL database integration
- User authentication dependencies

## Technologies Used

Frontend
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

Backend
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MySQL2
- JSON Web Token (JWT)
- bcrypt
- dotenv

