## Installation

1. Clone this repository:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/simra8602-cell/Swiftcart.git
```

2. Navigate to the backend folder:

```bash
cd Swiftcart/backend/backend
```

3. Install dependencies:

```bash
npm install
```

4. Configure your environment variables in a `.env` file according to your backend configuration.

5. Start the backend:

```bash
node server.js
```

##  Frontend

Open `index.html` in your browser to view the frontend.

